    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isn't something i can just \"decide\" to change? like, it’s not just a choice, it's like a pattern that won't let go. every time i try to do things differently, it just ends up back at the same place. it feels less like a path and more like a trap. it’s exhausting even trying to fight it.",
